<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome Provider</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .status-box { background: #fef3d0; border: 1px solid #f5d580; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
      .status-box p { margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #8a5c00; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Welcome to PowerMesh, <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>Thanks for applying as a provider on PowerMesh. Your account has been created successfully.</p>
      <div class="status-box">
        <p>Your application is now pending admin approval.</p>
      </div>
      <p>You will receive another email once your application has been reviewed by our team. This process typically takes 1-2 business days.</p>
      <p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; PowerMesh System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
